---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro'
---

<Layout title="联系我们 - XTCer">
  <main>
    <nav class="nav">
      <div class="nav-inner">
        <a href="/" class="nav-logo">XTCer</a>
        <div class="nav-links">
          <a href="/" class="nav-link">首页</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </nav>

    <article class="page">
      <h1>联系我们</h1>
      <p class="subtitle">如果您有任何问题、建议或合作意向，欢迎与我们联系。</p>

      <div class="contact-methods">
        <div class="contact-card">
          <div class="icon">
            <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path d="M4 4h16c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2v12c0 1.1-.9 2-2 2H4c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V6c0-1.1.9-2 2-2z"></path>
              <polyline points="22,6 12,13 2,6"></polyline>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h2>电子邮件</h2>
          <p><a href="mailto:xtccer@gmail.com">xtccer@gmail.com</a></p>
          <p class="note">我们会在 24 小时内回复</p>
        </div>

        <div class="contact-card">
          <div class="icon">
            <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path d="M21 11.5a8.38 8.38 0 0 1-.9 3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1-7.6 4.7 8.38 8.38 0 0 1-3.8-.9L3 21l1.9-5.7a8.38 8.38 0 0 1-.9-3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1 4.7-7.6 8.38 8.38 0 0 1 3.8-.9h.5a8.48 8.48 0 0 1 8 8v.5z"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h2>社交媒体</h2>
          <p>Twitter: <a href="https://twitter.com/ctoocn" target="_blank" rel="noopener">@ctoocn</a></p>
          <p class="note">关注我们获取最新动态</p>
        </div>

        <div class="contact-card">
          <div class="icon">
            <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path d="M9 19c-5 1.5-5-2.5-7-3m14 6v-3.87a3.37 3.37 0 0 0-.94-2.61c3.14-.35 6.44-1.54 6.44-7A5.44 5.44 0 0 0 20 4.77 5.07 5.07 0 0 0 19.91 1S18.73.65 16 2.48a13.38 13.38 0 0 0-7 0C6.27.65 5.09 1 5.09 1A5.07 5.07 0 0 0 5 4.77a5.44 5.44 0 0 0-1.5 3.78c0 5.42 3.3 6.61 6.44 7A3.37 3.37 0 0 0 9 18.13V22"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h2>GitHub</h2>
          <p>github.com/xtccoding</p>
          <p class="note">查看我们的开源项目</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <section class="faq">
        <h2>常见问题</h2>

        <div class="question">
          <h3>如何添加内容？</h3>
          <p>访问管理后台，通过 Supabase 的表编辑器添加和管理内容。</p>
        </div>

        <div class="question">
          <h3>网站是免费的吗？</h3>
          <p>是的，XTCer 完全免费使用。我们通过展示广告来维持运营。</p>
        </div>

        <div class="question">
          <h3>可以自定义域名吗？</h3>
          <p>可以。在 Cloudflare Pages 设置中添加自定义域名即可。</p>
        </div>
      </section>
    </article>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .page { max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 3rem 0; }
  .page h1 { font-size: 2rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 0.375rem; }
  .subtitle { color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 3rem; }
  section { margin-bottom: 2rem; }
  h2 { font-size: 1.125rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }
  p { color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 0.9375rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; line-height: 1.8; }
  ul { margin: 0.75rem 0; padding-left: 1.5rem; color: var(--text-secondary); }
  li { margin-bottom: 0.375rem; line-height: 1.6; }
  a { color: var(--primary); }
  .contact-methods { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr)); gap: 1rem; margin-bottom: 3rem; }
  .contact-card { background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 12px; padding: 1.5rem; text-align: center; }
  .icon { color: var(--primary); margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .contact-card h2 { font-size: 1rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
  .contact-card p { color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.875rem; margin-bottom: 0.25rem; }
  .note { font-size: 0.75rem !important; color: var(--text-muted); }
  .faq { margin-top: 2rem; }
  .faq h2 { font-size: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
  .question { background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 12px; padding: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .question h3 { font-size: 1rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
  .question p { color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.875rem; margin: 0; }
</style>
